FTP: the FTP client, without FTP over SSL (no OpenSSL);
php56-ftp-openssl has it.

The module ftp of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/ftp.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/ftp.
